WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.399 --> 00:00:09.920
On this day, exactly a 100 years ago two very
disgruntled Hungairan representatives signed

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:14.659
a peace treaty at the Grand Trianon Palace
in Versailles, officially ending the Great

00:00:14.659 --> 00:00:16.720
War for Hungary.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:20.800
Now to explain the treaty of Trianon dealing
with Hungary and its brother the Treaty of

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:25.339
Saint-Germain dealing with Austria, we have
to understand the very complicated state of

00:00:25.339 --> 00:00:28.759
Austria and Hungary at the end of the Great
War.

00:00:28.759 --> 00:00:33.260
The end of the Great War for Austria-Hungary
was anything but orderly, the decentralization

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:37.750
of control across the entire empire combined
with food shortages bordering on a famine

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:43.270
resulted in, mutenies, revolutions, counter
revolutions, wars, and new nationstates.

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:49.190
It was a time of ideological clashes and political
maneuvering by big and small players alike.

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:50.960
So what exactly happened.

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:55.970
Well a lot actually happened in a short amount
of time, so to try to explain it in a hopefully

00:00:55.970 --> 00:01:00.460
comprehensive way I am going to try to give
you an Austro-Hungarian centric chronological

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:03.690
overview of the major events at the end of
the Great War.

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:08.190
By the time of October 1918 it became clear
to everyone in the Austro-Hungarian Empire

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:12.940
that the war is going to be over soon and
therefore any existent imperial control within

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:15.250
the country pretty much fell apart.

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:19.870
This meant many local councils started acting
as independent provisional governments signaling

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:21.180
the breakup of Austria-Hungary.

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:28.570
5-8th of October 1918 high ranking people
of society and politicians of the South Slavs

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.710
in Austria Hungary declared the People’s
Council a representative council of all South

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:35.690
Slavic people in Austria Hungary.

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:39.550
At this point this council is still divided
amongst the supporters of an Austro-Hungarian

00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:42.120
federation or complete succession.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:48.610
7th of October 1918, the regency Council of
the German Puppet Polish state, which was

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:53.080
established a year prior, seeing that the
central powers were growing weaker, announced

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.700
its intention of creating an independent Poland.

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:56.740
(And started centralizing it’s power)

00:01:56.740 --> 00:02:02.840
13th of October 1918, enlight of the intentions
of making an independent Polish state the

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:06.640
National Organization of Zakopane is formed
and starts making preparations for succession.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:15.040
14th of October, Romanians in Bukovina form
an Executive Committee that starts the process

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:17.609
of incorporating bukovina into Romania.

00:02:17.609 --> 00:02:21.599
This is actively protested by Ukranians living
in northern Bukovina.

00:02:21.599 --> 00:02:27.010
16th of October 1918, Emperor Charles tries
to save the crumbling Empire by an Imperial

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:32.730
Manifesto proclaiming the formation of a federal
state with autonomous rights to all minorities.

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:37.349
Even though this was embraced by some people
like the many aforementioned federation supporters

00:02:37.349 --> 00:02:41.980
in the South Slavic People’s Council, it
was also hated by the more conservative German

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:44.010
Austrians and specially Hungarians.

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:48.819
Plus it was too late in the war as the allies
already recognized the independence of Czechoslovakia

00:02:48.819 --> 00:02:53.579
in the summer of 1918 and on top of that they
had also decided by this point that they won't

00:02:53.579 --> 00:02:57.470
allow any continuation of Habsburg rule in
Central Europe.

00:02:57.470 --> 00:03:03.260
18th of October, Romanians in Transylvania
declare the independence of Transylvania and

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:06.189
start the gradual process of uniting with
Romania.

00:03:06.189 --> 00:03:10.200
This is actively opposed by Transilvanian
Hungarians and also Germans however the german

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:14.609
speaking population of Transylvania later
acquiesces to uniting with Romania.

00:03:14.609 --> 00:03:20.239
21st of October, the remaining 208 German
speaking delegates of the Austrian Imperial

00:03:20.239 --> 00:03:25.221
Council convene; other delegates of the Empire’s
minorities no longer recognized the Imperial

00:03:25.221 --> 00:03:26.221
Council.

00:03:26.221 --> 00:03:30.720
Seeing the empire dissolving to its ethnic
components the Council established the "Provisional

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:32.510
National Assembly of German-Austria".

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:38.299
23rd of October, the Second Polish republic
is officially declared and starts trying to

00:03:38.299 --> 00:03:40.140
consolidate its power.

00:03:40.140 --> 00:03:44.900
24th of October, the Hungarian Government,
seeing that basically the entire kingdom was

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:48.690
falling apart, recalls all of its troops from
the front lines.

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:54.829
25th of October, the Hungarian Social Democratic
Party, the Liberal Left Party and the Bourgeois

00:03:54.829 --> 00:03:59.779
Radical Party form the Hungarian National
Council headed by Mihály Károlyi which among

00:03:59.779 --> 00:04:04.219
other things calls for the termination of
the war, the Independence from Vienna, the

00:04:04.219 --> 00:04:06.859
recognition of minority rights, universal
suffrage, etc.

00:04:06.859 --> 00:04:12.959
28th of October, Austria-Hungary officially
starts pursuing armistice talks.

00:04:12.959 --> 00:04:17.709
That same day the South Slavic Council sends
a peace note to America without the Austro-Hunagrian

00:04:17.709 --> 00:04:21.329
consent meaning they were now acting as an
independent entity.

00:04:21.329 --> 00:04:26.860
The Viceroy of Croatia reports this to the
Emperor who simply replies "Do as you please.".

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:30.720
Now those are the words of a man who is watching
his Empire crumble before him.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:33.979
That same day independence of Czechia is declared
in Prague.

00:04:33.979 --> 00:04:38.330
And also that same day the Polish Liquidation
Committee (that sounds like something from

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:43.479
WW2, anyways) was created, its main goal was
to hold order in Austrian Galicia before the

00:04:43.479 --> 00:04:48.379
Polish Second Republic was able to centralize
all the various autonomous Polish territories.

00:04:48.379 --> 00:04:53.991
29th of October, the South Slavic People’s
Council proclaims the formation of the State

00:04:53.991 --> 00:04:59.560
of Slovenes, Croats and Serbs and also the
Serbs of Vojvodina proclaim their own independence.

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:04.150
That same day Czechoslovakia is declared by
both Czech and Slovak representatives.

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:09.150
30th of October, Slovaks declare independence
of Slovakia in Martin.

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:12.930
Even though a day before then they declared
the creation of Czechoslovakia, I don’t

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:15.240
know I guess they were trying to tie up lose
ends.

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:19.400
Also on this day even though acting as an
independent entity since the 13th of October

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:25.520
the National Organization of Zakopane officially
succedes, creating the Republic of Zakopane,

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:29.740
although they will later relinquish power
to te Polish Liquidation Committee.

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:34.300
Also on this day both Poles and Czechs living
in Těšín Silesia establish separate councils

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:38.940
and declare the area under the control of
the new Czechoslovakia or Poland respectively.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:44.080
A couple of days later they will come to a
tenues demarcation agreement that will certainly

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:46.300
not cause any problems later.

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:51.980
31st of October, the many disgruntled and
now disbanded Hungarian soldiers that have

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:56.780
returned home from the front start the Aster
Revolution in Budapest led by Károlyi.

00:05:56.780 --> 00:06:01.020
The revolution is successful and that same
day Charles the 4th of Hungary has no choice

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:06.300
but to accept Károlyi as the new prime minister
of Hungary who then promptly dissolves the

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:09.500
Austro-Hunagrian union proclaiming the independence
of Hungary.

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:14.129
However even though now independent Károlyi
still wants Hungary to Remain a kingdom.

00:06:14.129 --> 00:06:18.789
This same day the State of Slovenes, Croats
and Serbs start pursuing unification talks

00:06:18.789 --> 00:06:23.199
with the kingdom of Serbia and Montenegro,
these are however divisive because even though

00:06:23.199 --> 00:06:27.470
some Sloven and Croat politicians are for
it others want to establish the way the new

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:32.639
Yugoslav kingdom is going to be governed before
agreeing to a unification, while others like

00:06:32.639 --> 00:06:36.530
Stjepan Radić are completely against the
unification.

00:06:36.530 --> 00:06:41.129
Also this same day or 2 days later, sources
are unclear, the Hungarians living in Banat

00:06:41.129 --> 00:06:43.740
declare the creation of the Banat Republic.

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:48.939
This republic is actively opposed by the Romanian
and Serbian populations living in Banat.

00:06:48.939 --> 00:06:54.310
1st of November 1918, The West Ukrainian People's
Republic is declared.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:59.199
A state which had a majority of Ukranians
but a very sizable minority of Poles on top

00:06:59.199 --> 00:07:04.219
of that it claimed the majority Ukranian lands
in Bukovina, therefore right after its succession

00:07:04.219 --> 00:07:08.810
it became entangled in a conflict with the
new Polish Republic and Romanian.

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:15.100
2nd of November 1918, Károlyi’s new Hungarian
government under the Woodrow Wilson's demand

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:19.430
of pacifism disarms the Hungarian military
apart from a couple of troops.

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:23.720
Károlyi was hoping that this preemptive disarmament
will show the allies that Hungary is willing

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:27.210
to cooperate and therefore will receive a
milder peace deal.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:32.490
On the same day unbenounced to the Austro-Hunagrian
armistice negotiations going on Károlyi starts

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:36.229
his own armistice negotiations with the allied
generals in Belgrade.

00:07:36.229 --> 00:07:42.370
3rd of November, Austria-Hungary signs an
armistice officially effective a day later.

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:47.470
Among other things the Villa Giusti armistice
designates an Italian occupation zone, coordinates

00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:52.470
the dismantle and division of the imperial
navy, sets up a ceasefire on all Austro-Hungarian

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:57.400
fronts and premites all allied armies to take
control of any point within Austria-Hungary

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:59.479
that they deem strategically important.

00:07:59.479 --> 00:08:05.060
4th of November, Italian troops to the protest
of the self proclaimed State of Slovenes,

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:10.460
Croats and Serbs start occupying Istria, Dalmatia
and southern Austria as lined out by the Villa

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:11.870
Giusti armistice.

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:18.490
5th of November, the allied officers in Belgrade
negotiating with Hungary only now learn of

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:23.300
the Villa Giusti armistice and ask Paris whether
this also applies to the new state of Hungary

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:25.740
and if they should continue armistice talks
with Károlyi.

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:31.000
The reply says the Villa Giusti armistice
does apply to the new state of Hungary but

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:33.140
continue the armistice negotiations anyways.

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:37.980
This was most likely because the allies were
hoping for a more favorable (to them) armistice

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:41.290
deal with Hungary over what they got with
the Villa Giusti armistice.

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:45.730
Ironically Károlyi also continued with the
Belgrade armistice negotiations because he

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:49.070
was hoping to get a more favorable armistice
deal for Hungary.

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:54.180
7th of November, Károlyi and his delegates
reach an armistice agreement with the allied

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:55.240
generals in Belgrade.

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:59.720
I will try to give an oversimplified view
of the armistice talks and the main points

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:00.950
discussed in it.

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:05.110
Károlyi’s main points during the armistice
negotiations are as follows.

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:09.180
Hungary was under Austrian control at the
start of the war and therefore the Great War

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:12.650
shouldn’t be blamed on the now new and independent
Hungary.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:18.350
Károlyi’s government will give every minority
within Hungary and I quote “maximum autonomy”

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:22.210
which in their eyes satisfies Wilson's point
of self determination.

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:26.740
The post war occupation of Hungary should
be done exclusively by French, British and

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:30.930
American troops as the Hungarians fear if
Romanian or Czechoslovak troops enter Hungary

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:33.750
they will never leave and would raid the land.

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:38.700
Hungary should retain the right of administering
its own land even if under allied occupation

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:42.500
(With Croatia and Slovenia being exempt from
this).

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:45.900
Czechoslovakia is to be forced by the allies
to allow coal shipments from Germany into

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:50.520
Hungary as Hungary has no coal supplies of
its own, and winter was coming.

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:55.020
The first point was quickly shot down by the
allies who pointed out that Hungary with Austria

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:59.190
had equal say within the Austro-Hunagrian
system and therefore should be equally responsible

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:03.380
for the war no matter if a new revolutionary
government was now in power.

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:08.040
The second point wasn’t necessarily refused
by the allies but they did already agree during

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:12.460
the war to give almost all minority populated
areas of Hungary to their respective nations

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:13.680
hence it was mute.

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:16.080
The third point was also refused.

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:21.170
The 4th point was allowed and Hungary under
the Belgrade armistice was to retain administrative

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:25.060
control over all of its land even if under
allied occupation.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.020
The 5th point was also allowed.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:31.900
The treaty also talked about all kinds of
other stuff like the specifics of reparation

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:37.570
quatas, demilitarization, prisoners of war,
demarcation lines, etc. but we don’t have

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:38.660
time to get into that.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:42.590
As it stands Károlyi is pretty happy with
the treaty as even though not everything went

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:46.880
their way they still will be allowed to retain
administrative rights over the whole of Hungary

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:51.380
(excluding Slovenia and Croatia), which was
a victory for them.

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:54.640
However the treaty still needs to be ratified
by both the Hungarian parliament in Budapest

00:10:54.640 --> 00:10:58.590
and the allies in Paris so it is not official
yet.

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:04.020
9th of November, Romania reenters the Great
War renouncing the Peace Treaty of Bucharest,

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:08.070
it mainly does this, even though an armistice
with Austria-Hungary has already been signed,

00:11:08.070 --> 00:11:11.940
because it wants to make sure it will receive
the lands promised to it by the allies when

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:13.980
it joined the war in 1916.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:19.880
11th of November, an armistice with Germany
is signed officially ending the Great War.

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:23.810
On that same day Emperor Charles under the
pressure from the allies and also some of

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:29.010
his subjects "relinquishes every participation
in the administration of the state" of Austria.

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:31.240
He however never officially “abdicates”.

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:37.890
It was his son Otto von Habsburg who officially
renounced all claims to the throne in 1961,

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:38.890
but I digress.

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:43.770
12th of November, the “provisional national
assembly of German-Austria” now with no

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:47.010
monarch declares the Republic of German-Austria.

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:51.130
On the same day Hungary who still didn’t
ratify the Belgrade armistice is informed

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:56.220
by Paris that the allied commanders in Belgrade
could have discussed only military matters

00:11:56.220 --> 00:12:00.030
not political onse, which means that all the
political points of the armistice like the

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:03.470
very important administrative one no longer
apply.

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:07.400
This means that the Belgrade armistice is
basically just an occupation treaty at this

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:08.400
point.

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:14.100
13th of November, Emperor Charles officially
recognizes Hungarian independence and also

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:18.550
just like with Austria "relinquishes every
participation in the administration of the

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:19.550
state" of Hungary.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:24.781
This same day the Hungarian parliament reluctantly
accepts the Belgrade armistice because, well

00:12:24.781 --> 00:12:26.090
they have no choice.

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:32.180
14th of November, Allied troops including
Serbian, Romanian and Czechoslovak start entering

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:35.630
Hungarian territory up to the decided demarcation
zone.

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:40.810
The Provisional Transilvanian, Bukovina, Slovak,
Serbs of Vojvodina, etc. governments that

00:12:40.810 --> 00:12:45.580
declared their independence prior got gradually
absorbed into their respective countries.

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:48.620
However as it will become clear this was not
without a fight.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:53.620
For example unlike in the south or east there
was never any specific demarcation line set

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:58.550
for Slovakia in the Belgrade Armistice so
Czechoslovak troops and Hungarian troops started

00:12:58.550 --> 00:13:01.890
fighting each other over Slovakia for the
next few weeks.

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:07.240
16th of November, due to Charles’ “withdrawal”
from Hungarian affairs Károlyi who wanted

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:12.730
to continue the Hungarian Kingdom had no choice
but to now officially proclaim the First Hungarian

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:13.730
Republic.

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:19.200
18th of November, the State of Slovenes, Croats
and Serbs fearing further Italian expansion

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:23.940
in to their country send an official protest
to the allies about the Italian occupation.

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:28.210
At the same time they were also struggling
to keep order in the state and therefore the

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:31.980
council finally decides to unite with the
kingdom of Serbia and Montenegro.

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:35.860
They were also advised by the allies to do
so as the allies promised the Serbians they

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:37.780
will help them form Yugoslavia.

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:44.050
1st of December 1918, the Kingdom of Serbs,
Croats, and Slovenes is officially declared

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:45.560
by the serbian monarch.

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:52.350
3rd of December 1918, The allies finally set
a demarcation line in Slovakia ordering Hungarian

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:56.940
troops to withdraw, ending the Czechoslovak
Hungarian fighting ... for now.

00:13:56.940 --> 00:14:02.890
5th of December, In retaliation of Polish
efforts to subjugate whole of Galicia the

00:14:02.890 --> 00:14:05.080
Lemko-Rusyn Republic is declared.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:09.610
Being Rusyn they didn’t want to join Poland
or the West Ukrainian People's Republic.

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:13.830
However the eastern half of the Lemko-Rusyn
Republic did want to join the West Ukrainian

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:18.610
People's Republic so they than declared independence
from the Lemko-Rusyn Republic to try to join

00:14:18.610 --> 00:14:20.850
the West Ukrainian People's Republic.

00:14:20.850 --> 00:14:25.580
That same day the Germans in Western Hungary
declare the Republic of Heinzenland but this

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:30.110
will get occupied by Hungarian troops just
two days later.

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:32.880
That is where I will conclude my chronological
summary.

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:38.130
As you may have noticed by now central Europe
at the end of 1918 was in disarray and even

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:42.570
though my definitely not all encompassing
chronological presentation may make it seem

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:47.530
a bit less chaotic keep in mind due to communication
issues everything wasn’t so straightforward

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:48.870
as I presented it.

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:53.940
For example the whole Belgrade armistice negotiations
are full of back and forth telegrams between

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:57.671
Paris, the allied commanders, the hungarian
embassy and the Hungarian parliament, all

00:14:57.671 --> 00:15:02.280
of whom always had to wait for each other's
reply only to sometimes receive a different

00:15:02.280 --> 00:15:05.530
reply the next day resulting in a pretty confusing
mess.

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:08.841
Plus while all of this was happening the commanders
on the front lines sometimes didn’t know

00:15:08.841 --> 00:15:13.670
an armistice was being negotiated or even
signed and continued fighting, sometimes these

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:28.540
commanders knew of the armistice but continued
pushing anyways so they could gain more land.

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:34.140
But with all that said in early 1919 this
was roughly the state of land control in central

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:39.430
europe by various political entities, with
Austria and Hungary having very limited control

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:41.740
outside of their core areas.

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:45.740
And it was during this time that the Paris
peace conference formally started 18th of

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:52.680
January 1919 with all the major new and old
central european nations sending their representatives.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:57.620
The very confusing events of the following
two years along with the two very controversial

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:02.110
Paris Peace treaties that will eventually
resolve this political mess, are such big

00:16:02.110 --> 00:16:04.680
topics that they deserve their own videos.

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:07.170
Both of which I will release next month.

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:11.420
One on the 16 of July, the 100th anniversary
of the Treaty of Saint-Germain coming into

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:12.420
effect.

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:15.420
And
One on the 31st of July the 99th anniversary

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:17.470
of the Treaty of Trianon coming into effect.

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:24.420
I mean today was the 100th anniversary of
the singing of the Trianon but I had to give

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:28.990
some background before dealing with it, hence
we will have to settle with the 99th anniversary

00:16:28.990 --> 00:16:32.070
of the treaty coming into effect as the release
date for that video

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:36.220
